  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(71, 114, 157)\n\n(36, 79, 122)\n\n**Logic:** Second no. = [(First no. + Third no.) ÷ 2]\n\n**(71, 114, 157) →**\n\n⇒ [(71 + 157) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (228 ÷ 2) = 114\n\n**(36, 79, 122) →**\n\n⇒ [(36 + 122) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (158 ÷ 2) = 79\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n**1.** (52, 95, 137)\n\n⇒ [(52 + 137) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (189 ÷ 2) = 94.5\n\n**2. (25, 68, 111)**\n\n⇒ [(25 + 111) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (136 ÷ 2) =** 68**\n\n**3. **(16, 56, 98)\n\n⇒ [(16 + 98) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (114 ÷ 2) = 57\n\n**4.** (5, 45, 88)\n\n⇒ [(5 + 88) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (93 ÷ 2) = 46.5\n\nHere, **(25, 68, 111)** shows a similar relation to the given set of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (2)\".",
